@startuml Profile Creation Flow

actor User
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "CreateProfile Component" as CP
participant "Form Handler" as Form
participant "Transaction Builder" as TX
participant "Wallet" as Wallet
participant "Sui Blockchain" as Blockchain
participant "Frontend Query" as Query
participant "Updated UI" as UpdatedUI

User -> UI: 1. Input username
UI -> CP: Pass input
CP -> Form: 2. Validate
activate Form
Form -> Form: Check length
Form -> Form: Check validity
Form --> CP: Validation result
deactivate Form

CP -> TX: 3. Build TX
activate TX
TX -> TX: Create transaction
TX -> TX: Add arguments
TX --> CP: Transaction object
deactivate TX

CP -> Wallet: 4. Request signature
activate Wallet
Wallet -> User: Confirm transaction
User --> Wallet: Approve
Wallet -> Wallet: Sign with private key
Wallet --> CP: Signed transaction
deactivate Wallet

CP -> Blockchain: 5. Execute transaction
activate Blockchain
Blockchain -> Blockchain: Validate username
Blockchain -> Blockchain: Check uniqueness
Blockchain -> Blockchain: Create UserProfile
Blockchain -> Blockchain: Update ProfileRegistry
Blockchain -> Blockchain: Emit event
Blockchain --> CP: Success
deactivate Blockchain

CP -> Query: 6. Trigger refetch
activate Query
Query -> Blockchain: Query updated data
Blockchain --> Query: Profile data
Query --> UpdatedUI: 7. Update state
deactivate Query

UpdatedUI -> User: Display new profile

@enduml
